{"seq":1,"slug":"pin-boost-bury-block","title":"置顶、加权、降权与屏蔽：导购干预的四种基本动作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/merchandising-rules/pin-boost-bury-block","wordCount":2664,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"置顶-加权-降权与屏蔽-导购干预的四种基本动作\">置顶、加权、降权与屏蔽：导购干预的四种基本动作</h1><p>运营同学在后台圈选了一批商品，点击「置顶」；三天后商品下架，搜索结果里仍然留着它——这类事故几乎每个电商搜索团队都经历过一次。根因通常不是运营粗心，而是「置顶」「加权」「降权」「屏蔽」这四个词被当成了 UI 上的按钮，而它们在检索系统里的语义差别极大：有的改顺序、有的改分数、有的根本不参与打分。本文把四种动作拆到执行层，讲清各自的正确实现位置与代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-干预动作的语义分层\">核心概念：干预动作的语义分层</h2><p>搜索结果列表可以抽象成一个有序集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = [d_1, d_2, \\dots, d_n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由一个排序分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(d_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定位次。任何人工干预最终都必须落到三件事之一：<strong>改集合的成员</strong>（谁在谁不在）、<strong>改成员之间的顺序</strong>（谁先谁后）、<strong>改分数本身</strong>（改多少）。四种动作正好覆盖这三个层面。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[干预请求] --&gt; B{动作类型}&#10;    B --&gt;|屏蔽| C[改集合成员&lt;br/&gt;filter/exclude]&#10;    B --&gt;|置顶| D[改顺序&lt;br/&gt;pinned / position]&#10;    B --&gt;|加权| E[改分数&lt;br/&gt;multiplicative boost]&#10;    B --&gt;|降权| F[改分数&lt;br/&gt;multiplicative penalty]&#10;    C --&gt; G[查询计划]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[结果列表]\">graph TD\n    A[干预请求] --&gt; B{动作类型}\n    B --&gt;|屏蔽| C[改集合成员&lt;br/&gt;filter/exclude]\n    B --&gt;|置顶| D[改顺序&lt;br/&gt;pinned / position]\n    B --&gt;|加权| E[改分数&lt;br/&gt;multiplicative boost]\n    B --&gt;|降权| F[改分数&lt;br/&gt;multiplicative penalty]\n    C --&gt; G[查询计划]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[结果列表]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>生效层面</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>置顶</td>\n<td>顺序</td>\n<td>pinned query / 位置回填</td>\n<td>高（删规则即恢复）</td>\n<td>坑位空置、与自然结果重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权</td>\n<td>分数</td>\n<td>乘子（boost multiplier）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>分数尺度失衡、压垮相关性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降权</td>\n<td>分数</td>\n<td>乘子或减项</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>被降权商品直接消失（过度惩罚）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏蔽</td>\n<td>集合</td>\n<td>filter / MUST_NOT</td>\n<td>中（历史查询缓存）</td>\n<td>召回塌陷、二次上架不同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四者的<strong>可逆性差异</strong>是设计时的第一考虑。屏蔽把文档从候选集里摘掉，一旦摘掉，下游所有依赖候选集的东西（相关性命中率、类目覆盖度、无结果率）都会变；而加权只是让文档在列表里挪位，列表长度不变。因此工程上有一条经验法则：<strong>能用降权解决的，不要用屏蔽</strong>。只有当商品确实不该出现在任何结果里（假货、违规、法务下架）时才应该屏蔽。</p>\n<p>四个动作的最终分数可以统一写成一行：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>adj</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>pin</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{final}}(d) = \\Big(s_{\\text{rel}}(d) \\cdot \\prod_{r \\in R_{\\text{adj}}(d)} m_r\\Big) + \\sum_{r \\in R_{\\text{pin}}(d)} \\Delta_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6941em;vertical-align:-1.5441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5883em;vertical-align:-1.5383em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.334em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5383em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是加权/降权规则给出的乘子（加权 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_r &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，降权 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 &lt; m_r &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是置顶规则给出的位次补偿项。这个统一式子在后面的章节会反复出现：它的意义是让「所有干预都是可解释的分数改写」，而不是散落在代码各处的 if-else。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置顶-位置回填而不是分数竞赛\">置顶：位置回填而不是分数竞赛</h2><p>置顶最容易写错的地方，是用一个巨大的 boost 乘子（比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span>）去「顶」商品。这样做在候选集小的时候看似有效，但随着自然分数分布变化会失效：某些长尾查询的头部自然分极低，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 也顶不上去；而热门查询的头部自然分很高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 会让多个置顶商品把整个第一屏挤满，且它们之间的相对顺序完全由自然分决定，运营无法控制。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是<strong>位置回填（position backfill）</strong>：检索阶段照常跑，得到自然列表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>org</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{org}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">org</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；后处理阶段按置顶规则把目标商品<strong>插到指定位置</strong>，同时从原位置移除。伪代码层面是这样：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function applyPins(list, pins):&#10;  for pin in sorted(pins, by=position):&#10;    doc = fetch(pin.docId)          # 独立取回，不依赖召回&#10;    if doc is None or not doc.sellable:&#10;      continue                       # 关键：空坑位直接跳过，不阻塞&#10;    list.remove(doc)&#10;    list.insert(min(pin.position, len(list)), doc)&#10;  return list\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function applyPins(list, pins):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for pin in sorted(pins, by=position):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    doc = fetch(pin.docId)          # 独立取回，不依赖召回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if doc is None or not doc.sellable:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      continue                       # 关键：空坑位直接跳过，不阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    list.remove(doc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    list.insert(min(pin.position, len(list)), doc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return list</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有两个必须坚持的约束。第一，<strong>置顶商品要独立取回</strong>（按 ID 直查 CDN/索引），不能只从召回集合里挑；否则「运营置顶了一个没有自然召回的冷门商品」这个最常见的诉求就无法满足。第二，<strong>空坑位跳过而非阻塞</strong>——这是上一段提到的下架事故的解药：规则评估阶段就要校验可售状态，不可售则整条置顶规则本次失效，而不是把一个死链插进结果。</p>\n<p>置顶还有一类变体叫<strong>类目占位（category slot）</strong>：不指定具体商品，而是指定「美妆类目至少占前 10 位中的 2 位」。这类规则实现上更接近配额约束，本质是在排序后做一轮带约束的重排，属于 <a href=\"../campaign-injection/campaign-slots\">活动坑位与商品注入</a> 要处理的问题，本文不展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加权与降权-在哪个分数域上动手\">加权与降权：在哪个分数域上动手</h2><p>「加权」听起来无害，但它作用于哪个分数上，结果完全不同。检索系统里通常至少有三种分数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>召回分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>ret</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{ret}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ret</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：倒排/向量召回的原始相似度（BM25、内积）。</li>\n<li><strong>粗排分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>coarse</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{coarse}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coarse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：轻量模型对召回结果的打分。</li>\n<li><strong>精排分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>rank</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{rank}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rank</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：LTR 模型输出的最终排序依据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把 boost 乘子加在召回分上，会改变<strong>进入精排的候选集合</strong>——这是最危险的做法，因为精排模型没见过被异常放大的分布，容易给出连锁错误。把 boost 加在精排分上，影响的是<strong>已选候选之间的顺序</strong>，这是最可控的。所以在大多数商用系统里，运营的加权/降权应该严格落在精排分之后的重排层。</p>\n<p>Elasticsearch 用 <code>function_score</code> 的 <code>field_value_factor</code> / <code>weight</code> 函数表达乘子，Vespa 用 ranking expression 里的 <code>if</code> 与 <code>attribute</code> 项，Lucene 底层则是 <code>BoostQuery</code> 包裹。无论哪种，共同点是：<strong>乘子应该是有限个离散档位，而不是运营随意填的连续值</strong>。给出 <code>1.1 / 1.3 / 1.5</code> 三档加权和 <code>0.7 / 0.5</code> 两档降权，比给一个自由数值输入框稳健得多，因为它让效果可解释、可回归（见 <a href=\"../global-effectiveness/merchandising-attribution\">导购干预效果归因度量</a>），也避免运营误填 <code>100</code> 造成事故。</p>\n<p>降权还有一个数学上的陷阱：乘子对<strong>长尾列表</strong>的破坏远大于头部。若某个降权商品的分数是头部的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/50</span></span></span></span></span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 后它掉到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/100</span></span></span></span></span>，几乎是消失；但如果它本来在第 3 位，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 可能只掉到第 5 位。这不是 bug，而是乘子作用在乘法尺度上的必然结果。若要「稳定下移 k 位」这种运营直觉，应该用<strong>位置惩罚</strong>而非分数惩罚：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>gap</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = -k \\cdot \\text{gap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gap</span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>gap</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{gap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gap</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是局部相邻分数差的估计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"屏蔽-硬过滤与软降权的边界\">屏蔽：硬过滤与软降权的边界</h2><p>屏蔽在查询计划里是一个 <code>MUST_NOT</code>（Lucene）或 <code>NOT IN</code>（SQL 风格），它在<strong>召回之前</strong>生效。这个位置决定了它的两个特征：成本低、副作用大。</p>\n<p>成本低是因为过滤掉了文档不参与后续打分；副作用大是因为它同时污染所有下游指标。屏蔽一个类目的全部商品，会让该类目查询的<strong>无结果率</strong>从 0.3% 飙到 20%，而如果这个类目是搜索流量的头部，首页无结果率会立刻在监控上显形。所以屏蔽规则上线前必须做<strong>影响面预估</strong>：把规则表达式在离线查询日志上跑一遍，统计命中比例、受影响查询数、预计新增无结果查询数。这个预估是屏蔽类规则的强制门禁，加权类规则可以放宽。</p>\n<p>同样重要的是<strong>屏蔽的时效性</strong>。屏蔽规则天然带时间窗（法务下架通常 48 小时内解除），而检索层往往有<strong>查询结果缓存</strong>。一条昨天生效的屏蔽规则，可能因为缓存而今天仍在生效；反过来，解除屏蔽后缓存里的旧结果也会继续给出「已下架」的商品。解决办法不是关掉缓存，而是把<strong>干预版本的指纹</strong>作为缓存 key 的一部分：规则集版本号变化即整体失效缓存。这条设计会在 <a href=\"rule-conflict-resolution\">多规则冲突与优先级</a> 里再次出现，因为冲突解析的产物就是一个新版本号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[查询请求] --&gt; V{读取干预版本指纹}&#10;    V --&gt; C{缓存命中?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| R[返回缓存结果]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| F[屏蔽过滤 MUST_NOT]&#10;    F --&gt; S[召回 + 粗排 + 精排]&#10;    S --&gt; B[加权/降权乘子]&#10;    B --&gt; P[置顶位置回填]&#10;    P --&gt; W[写回缓存 带指纹]&#10;    W --&gt; R\">flowchart TD\n    Q[查询请求] --&gt; V{读取干预版本指纹}\n    V --&gt; C{缓存命中?}\n    C --&gt;|是| R[返回缓存结果]\n    C --&gt;|否| F[屏蔽过滤 MUST_NOT]\n    F --&gt; S[召回 + 粗排 + 精排]\n    S --&gt; B[加权/降权乘子]\n    B --&gt; P[置顶位置回填]\n    P --&gt; W[写回缓存 带指纹]\n    W --&gt; R</pre><p>上图是整个干预管道的执行顺序，其中的顺序不可交换：先过滤（省算力）、再打分（改分数）、最后回填（改顺序）。把置顶放在过滤之前会导致置顶商品绕过屏蔽校验——这是一个真实的线上事故模式，运营屏蔽了某商家的商品，但另一条置顶规则仍把它顶上首页。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则引擎落地-dsl-版本与干跑\">规则引擎落地：DSL、版本与干跑</h2><p>把四种动作统一之后，规则引擎的职责就很清晰了：接收运营表达的规则，编译成上述三段式管道，并保证可审计。一个够用的规则 DSL 至少要有五个字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>action</code></td>\n<td>四种动作之一</td>\n<td><code>boost</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>target</code></td>\n<td>作用对象（商品 ID / 类目 / 品牌 / SKU 属性）</td>\n<td><code>brand: &quot;Acme&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scope</code></td>\n<td>生效范围（市场、站点、查询模式、时段）</td>\n<td><code>market: &quot;DE&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>value</code></td>\n<td>动作参数（乘子档位、位置号、理由码）</td>\n<td><code>multiplier: 1.3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>audit</code></td>\n<td>谁、何时、为什么</td>\n<td><code>operator</code>, <code>ticket</code>, <code>created_at</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>audit</code> 字段不是可选项。干预规则是人为改变商业结果的操作，出问题时第一个要回答的就是「谁在什么时候因为什么改了它」。没有审计字段的规则引擎，在合规审查（见 <a href=\"../global-effectiveness/per-market-merchandising\">导购规则按市场差异化</a>）时会直接被卡住。</p>\n<p>规则从后台保存到线上生效，中间必须有**干跑（dry-run）**环节：用一批固定的黄金查询集（golden queries）跑规则变更前后的两版结果，生成差异报告——哪些查询的首位变了、哪些商品位移超过 5 位、有没有出现空坑位。这份报告既是运营的确认材料，也是回归测试的基线。干跑不需要真实流量，因此可以放在 CI 里，和代码变更走同一套门禁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四种干预动作落在三个层面：屏蔽改集合、置顶改顺序、加权降权改分数。混淆层面是绝大多数实现事故的源头。</li>\n<li>置顶要用<strong>位置回填</strong>而不是巨大乘子，且必须支持独立取回与空坑位跳过。</li>\n<li>加权降权应作用于精排之后的分数域，乘子用<strong>离散档位</strong>而非自由数值；乘子对长尾列表的破坏远大于头部。</li>\n<li>屏蔽是召回前的硬过滤，成本低但污染下游指标，上线前必须做影响面预估，且缓存 key 要含干预版本指纹。</li>\n<li>管道顺序固定为「过滤 → 打分 → 回填」，顺序交换会导致绕过与重复。</li>\n<li>规则 DSL 必须带审计字段与干跑环节；干跑报告是回归基线，不是可选流程。</li>\n<li>四种动作的生效范围如何表达、如何避免规则数量爆炸，是下一章 <a href=\"rule-scope-conditions\">规则作用域（品类/市场/查询）</a> 的主题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"置顶、加权、降权与屏蔽：导购干预的四种基本动作","id":"置顶-加权-降权与屏蔽-导购干预的四种基本动作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：干预动作的语义分层","id":"核心概念-干预动作的语义分层"},{"level":2,"text":"置顶：位置回填而不是分数竞赛","id":"置顶-位置回填而不是分数竞赛"},{"level":2,"text":"加权与降权：在哪个分数域上动手","id":"加权与降权-在哪个分数域上动手"},{"level":2,"text":"屏蔽：硬过滤与软降权的边界","id":"屏蔽-硬过滤与软降权的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"规则引擎落地：DSL、版本与干跑","id":"规则引擎落地-dsl-版本与干跑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"规则作用域：品类、市场与查询三级定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/merchandising-rules/rule-scope-conditions"}}